        <mxCell id="departments" value="&lt;b style='color:#8B5CF6'&gt;departments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px'&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;🔗 parent_id → departments (self)&lt;br/&gt;department_manager_id : UUID&lt;br/&gt;name : VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL&lt;br/&gt;number : VARCHAR(100)&lt;br/&gt;is_deleted : BOOL&lt;br/&gt;created_at / updated_at&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
